        "profileId": "praxis-implementer",
        "hostId": "praxis-implementer",
        "scope": "global",
        "toolMode": "full"
      },
      "instructions": "Implement the plan. Commit the change and report the ref. On a recovery pass, diagnose the failure or structured findings supplied in the iteration context, apply a targeted fix, and report how each issue was addressed. Preserve the plan and required gates; do not weaken checks to make them pass. Commit the repaired change and report its ref so all downstream verification runs against the new revision.",
